Package: omnipath.client
Type: Package
Title: Install OmniPath Resources and Query Them Locally with DuckDB
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Schaul", email = "schauljonathan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads versioned OmniPath resources (Parquet files) into a local
    data directory and writes a DuckDB database of them. Query it with any SQL, or
    with the explorer's search, relation export and entity details, which are SQL
    macros in the database and give the same answers as the Python client
    'omnipath_client' and the hosted API. Both clients read and write the same data
    directory.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    DBI,
    duckdb (>= 1.5.0),
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    dbplyr,
    dplyr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
